  "headline": "Polri Conducts Ethics Hearing for Brigjen Tedjo in Treason Case",
  "seoTitle": "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo Treason Case Ethics Hearing",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police hold an ethics hearing for Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo following his designation as a suspect in a treason and wiretapping case.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Professional and Security Division of the Indonesian National Police held an ethics hearing for Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo.",
    "Brigjen Tedjo and Kombes Iman Imanuddin have been placed in special detention after being named suspects in an alleged treason case.",
    "Investigations into the case involve alleged wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto and the discovery of multiple command posts in Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have initiated formal professional ethics proceedings against Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo, a suspect in an ongoing treason investigation. The hearing is managed by the police's Professional and Security Division through the Professional Code of Ethics Commission. Alongside Kombes Iman Imanuddin, who is also a suspect, Brigjen Tedjo has been placed in special detention. Authorities are investigating allegations involving the wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As part of the broader criminal investigation, the Bareskrim Polri has conducted searches across various locations in Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang. These operations have led to the discovery of several command posts and the seizure of various items, including documents and banners. The police are continuing their inquiries into the scope of these activities and the individuals involved in the alleged plot.",
